915250","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-3764180-1847286114039771","game_id":"steam-3764180","kind":"update","title":"October 24, 2026 — Small Update","summary":"We didn’t expect so many people to try our demo. Thank you all so much!The demo’s content is still limited, and some basic features and parts of the experience need more work. We’re sorry for the inconvenience. We’ll keep improving the demo while continuing development on the Early Access version.What’s new:Added a main menu. Some features are still being worked on.Improved the in-game UI.Added an option to quit the game.Added initial crosshair feedback when firing. We’ll continue refining it.Ad","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-24T14:38:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114039771","verified_at":"2026-10-24T15:42:40Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3764180-1846651706696240","game_id":"steam-3764180","kind":"announcement","title":"Steam Next Fest Demo Out Now | Free Early Access Begins January 1, 2027","summary":"Hi everyone, I’m Yuanjie, the developer of Lone City.Lone City is taking part in Steam Next Fest, and the demo is now free to download! The base game will remain free forever and will launch in Early Access on Steam on January 1, 2027.What I most want you to try in this demo is playing in both first and third person.I’ll admit, I wanted it all: the immersion of first person, a good look at the sexy girls in third person, and movement and shooting that feel good in both. Getting all of that worki","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T17:51:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706696240","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:50:28Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3764180-1835871199311453","game_id":"steam-3764180","kind":"announcement","title":"Final Hours — Once This Ends, the Door Closes for Good","summary":"Lone City is an open-world survival game inspired by I Am Legend. Explore a vast post-apocalyptic world, fight unique threats in every region, and carve your name into the city forever. Our Kickstarter is in its final hours — this is the only crowdfunding campaign we'll ever run for this game.What's NewWe've been hard at work refining Lin An, our female lead — overhauling her model, polishing her animations, and designing a set of sexy lingerie exclusively for her. She'll have dozens of unique o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-21T18:25:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1835871199311453","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3764180-1831432155576135","game_id":"steam-3764180","kind":"update","title":"Major Update: Third-Person Mode, Kickstarter Launch & Steam Next Fest Plans","summary":"Hello everyone,We have an important update to share.The Lone City Kickstarter campaign is now live.https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/yangyuanjie/lone-cityFor us, this campaign is not just about funding. It is about finding the first people who are willing to stand with Lone City while it is still being built.Lone City is a post-apocalyptic survival game focused on loneliness, exploration, danger, and the fragile connections that remain after the world has fallen.We know Kickstarter does not g","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-03T20:33:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1831432155576135","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3764180-1830163047257694","game_id":"steam-3764180","kind":"announcement","title":"Our Kickstarter Page Is Now Live (Pre-Launch)","summary":"Hello everyone,We’ve just launched the Kickstarter pre-launch page for Lone City.This is an important step for us. For the first time, you can take a deeper look at the world we’re building—its atmosphere, characters, and direction.If you’re interested in what we’re creating, we’d really appreciate it if you could follow the campaign page. That small click helps us build momentum before launch—and it truly makes a difference.When the campaign goes live, you’ll be among the first to know.Follow o","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-16T14:56:14Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047257694","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3764180-1823825466505314","game_id":"steam-3764180","kind":"announcement","title":"Internal testing has begun.","summary":"Thank you to all the crowdfunding supporters. The game activation codes are now being sent out one after another, and the internal test has officially begun!This test will mainly focus on hardware performance, aiming to collect data on the actual running performance and smoothness of \"Solitary City\" under extreme graphics quality on computers with different configurations. Welcome everyone to actively participate. We also look forward to your feedback on the real game frame rate and experience i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-02-09T12:47:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1823825466505314","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3764180-1802354289682548","game_id":"steam-3764180","kind":"announcement","title":"“Lone City” makes its debut — Rebuilding humanity's legend amidst the silent rui","summary":"Hello everyone, nice to meet you. Thank you for checking out our game.This is Lone City — a free-to-play post-apocalyptic game inspired by I Am Legend. It tells the story of a lone survivor, a loyal dog, and a roaring muscle car, struggling to survive in a world where civilization has collapsed.The game will continue to grow with more content over time, and we sincerely look forward to your attention and support. If you enjoy it, feel free to invite your friends to join you on this journey throu","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-06-16T06:56:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1802354289682548","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:52:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3764180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:38Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:37Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3764180":"2026-10-26T10:59:38Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3764180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:37Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:37Z"},"3915250":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:38Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:38Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:59:38Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3764180","app_id":3764180,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:21Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"902d687db6cceb2045b8a567848ced0fc2da8d0842840cacda0a4178cd2b7408","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"《Lone City》